[{:db/id 17592186129186 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-8ca7d6fc-55d0-503c-8138-64f03d668ed2"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-8ca7d6fc-55d0-503c-8138-64f03d668ed2" :question/id #uuid "8ca7d6fc-55d0-503c-8138-64f03d668ed2" :question/math-academy-id "q-73850" :question/problem "Find the equation of the tangent hyperplane to the hypersurface $w=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2})$ at the point $(1,-1,1,0).$" :question/worked-solution "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}))=\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}))=\\frac{2y}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}))=-\\frac{2z}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(1,-1,1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,-1,1) & =\\frac{2(1)}{(1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}-(1)^{2}}=2 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,-1,1) & =\\frac{2(-1)}{(1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}-(1)^{2}}=-2 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,-1,1) & =-\\frac{2(1)}{(1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}-(1)^{2}}=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-0 & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,-1,1)+(y+1)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,-1,1)+(z-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,-1,1) \\\\ w & =2(x-1)-2(y+1)-2(z-1) \\\\ w & =2x-2-2y-2-2z+2 \\\\ -2x+2y+2z+w+2 & =0 \\\\ 2x-2y-2z-w-2 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-75cea473-3250-5a97-b3ad-a51baa102dcf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-75cea473-3250-5a97-b3ad-a51baa102dcf" :answer-field/id #uuid "75cea473-3250-5a97-b3ad-a51baa102dcf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-2cf0dc93-d9d4-5f21-8930-dd5004fc42a6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5110fa49-48ce-56a6-b93d-b9d08b07b745" "answer-72b11d02-8ab8-5c20-a244-f44e993b6792" "answer-e0e8ca25-16b2-54a8-b96c-ad5665775b39" "answer-728a521d-8a62-5203-8384-b89408abe64b" "answer-2cf0dc93-d9d4-5f21-8930-dd5004fc42a6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5110fa49-48ce-56a6-b93d-b9d08b07b745" :answer/id #uuid "5110fa49-48ce-56a6-b93d-b9d08b07b745" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+2y+2z-w-2=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-72b11d02-8ab8-5c20-a244-f44e993b6792" :answer/id #uuid "72b11d02-8ab8-5c20-a244-f44e993b6792" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+2y-2z-w+2=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e0e8ca25-16b2-54a8-b96c-ad5665775b39" :answer/id #uuid "e0e8ca25-16b2-54a8-b96c-ad5665775b39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-2y+2z+w-8=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-728a521d-8a62-5203-8384-b89408abe64b" :answer/id #uuid "728a521d-8a62-5203-8384-b89408abe64b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-2y-2z+w-2=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2cf0dc93-d9d4-5f21-8930-dd5004fc42a6" :answer/id #uuid "2cf0dc93-d9d4-5f21-8930-dd5004fc42a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-2y-2z-w-2=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-710af205-0718-5ccf-b346-4f23b266524d" :activity/id #uuid "710af205-0718-5ccf-b346-4f23b266524d" :activity/title "Tangent Planes to Surfaces" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050299 :activity/course 17592186046665 :activity/steps ["step-2b51d9b4-6f4d-519a-946f-18af30633fc4" "step-93f5b13c-94e0-5cb3-a51d-2c9c6f5ed98b" "step-536015a5-6f9f-597